2x2 BLOCK TAXONOMY
================================================================================
all orientations of a 2x2 fiber block: 16
by number of wins for the first fiber: {0: 1, 1: 4, 2: 6, 3: 4, 4: 1}
balanced 2-2 blocks: 6
double-round-robin matching blocks: 2
balanced row/column-star blocks, not fiber-schedule balanced: 4
matching blocks:
  [(0, 1), (1, 0)]
  [(0, 0), (1, 1)]

Lex blowup uses 4-0 or 0-4 blocks; it magnifies the old result.
SC/voltage blowups use matching 2-2 blocks; they store the old result as a parity.

