  n=5: normalized=64 parity_vectors=64 target=64
  n=6: normalized=1024 parity_vectors=1024 target=1024

FORMAL RULE
================================================================================
For base arc u -> v and voltage sigma_uv in F2:
  u_r -> v_{r+sigma_uv}
  v_r -> u_{r+sigma_uv+1}
for r=0,1.  Internal arcs are v_0 -> v_1.

sigma=0 for every edge gives the repo's SC blowup:
  same sheet follows T; opposite sheet follows T^op.

A sheet flip tau_v at each vertex sends
  sigma_uv -> sigma_uv + tau_u + tau_v.
The invariant data are triangle parities
  p_abc = sigma_ab + sigma_bc + sigma_ac.

